{"message":"The best combined bonus for a $600 paycheck appears to be the Green Fee-Free Account: you would receive $20 and she would receive $35, for a combined $55. She must deposit at least $300 of new money within 60 days, and you must have been a Rho-Bank checking customer for at least 30 days.

Important: because she is your roommate, this referral is not eligible if you are both registered at the same address. She must also be a new Rho-Bank customer with no account currently or within the past 12 months. Referral bonuses cannot be combined with another new-account promotion, and the deposit must remain for at least 30 days after the qualifying period ends.

For comparison, Light Blue totals $50 with a $500 deposit requirement, while Dark Green and Gold Years total more but require at least $1,000 and therefore do not fit a $600 paycheck. I could not confirm your checking-account tenure from the available information, so the Green Fee-Free recommendation assumes you have been a checking customer for at least 30 days."}
